      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.15 (vs ₹1.12 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.15 (up from ₹1.12 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹672.2m (up 27% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹149.7m (up 11% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 22% (down from 26% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 5% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 32% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
